LICENSE — RESERVED
==================

The license for this project is a RESERVED decision (see the build brief §9 and
STATE.md §RESERVED). It belongs to the project owner alone and has not been made.
This file is a deliberate placeholder, not an omission.

Why this gates the release
--------------------------
F-Droid eligibility for the `foss` flavor is *gated on this choice*: F-Droid only
accepts apps under an OSI/FSF-approved free-software license, with all build
inputs free. Until a specific license is chosen and a real LICENSE file with an
SPDX identifier lands here, the `foss` flavor cannot be published to F-Droid, and
no source file should carry an SPDX license header.

What must NOT happen
--------------------
Do not select, suggest, or infer a license in code, metadata, or copy. Do not add
SPDX headers. Do not add a `licenses` block to any Play/F-Droid metadata. The
placeholder stays until the owner decides.

When the decision is made
-------------------------
Replace this file with `LICENSE` containing the chosen license text, add the SPDX
identifier to F-Droid metadata (`fastlane/metadata`), and record the choice in
STATE.md.
